    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BURST is a small one to four player local sports game that takes a very different spin on bubble football. Try your luck against an overwhelming number of opponents and lay waste to the field in the process.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by hallmarks of the genre like NES World Cup  this game is also easy to pick up ideally enjoyed with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 - 4 player local co-op with gamepads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remote Play Together supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adaptive difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D retro pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tackle your your opponents to gain control over the field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >charge up and use a power shot to score a goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short 5 minute rounds, ideal for in-between times</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BURST is a small one to four player local sports game that takes a very different spin on bubble football. Try your luck against an overwhelming number of opponents and lay waste to the field in the process.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by hallmarks of the genre like NES World Cup  this game is also easy to pick up ideally enjoyed with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1 - 4 player local co-op with gamepads</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Remote Play Together supported</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >adaptive difficulty</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2D retro pixel graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >tackle your your opponents to gain control over the field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >charge up and use a power shot to score a goal</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >short 5 minute rounds, ideal for in-between times</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "One to four player sports action game taking a unique spin on the beloved leisure sport activity of bubble football. Play against an overwhelming number of (rather stupid) opponents and lay waste to the field in the process.",
